# Kept out of the build context. A host `node_modules` is the wrong
# architecture for the image and a stale `.next` would shadow the build.
# A real `.env` would be baked into a layer; the example is kept, and the
# re-include comes after `.env.*` because the last matching line wins.
node_modules
.next
tests
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
